    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Meet the reel harness. Audio first: silence trimmed, loudness tamed, reviewed words timed offline. Auto-Editor and WhisperX are installed, but model fetches stay off.",
      "start": 0.4,
      "end": 10.1
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Composition is code. HyperFrames mounts scenes; GSAP drives paused timelines. anime.js, mo.js, Rough.js, and Three.js animate cards, bursts, sketches, and wireframes.",
      "start": 10.3,
      "end": 27.3
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Remotion renders a clip; FFmpeg stitches it. Strict checks, QA, Pillow, Arabic shaping, soundfile, numpy, and skills audit stay local. Keyless. Offline. Run it again.",
      "start": 27.5,
      "end": 39.2
    }
  ],
